short_label: V.19
---
sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If a whole is to a whole as a part subtracted is to a part subtracted, then the remainder is also to the remainder as the whole is to the whole.
----
proof:

Let the whole *AB* be to the whole *CD* as the part *AE* subtracted is to the part *CF* subtracted.

I say that the remainder *EB* is also to the remainder *FD* as the whole *AB* is to the whole *CD.*

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="280" height="80" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="V.19 diagram" src="propV19.gif"/></noscript>
